    "pin": {
      "title": "Musée de Picardie",
      "description": "Museum in France",
      "extract": "The Musée de Picardie is the main museum of Amiens and Picardy, in France. It is located at 48, rue de la République, Amiens. Its collections include artifacts ranging from prehistory to the 19th century, and form one of the largest regional museums in France.",
